umentation for each scope variant and its fields, including what each selector and ref/pattern value means."}],"notVerified":["The full bun run check and broader Busy Bee suite were not independently rerun by this reviewer; their results are supplied by the implementation task update."]}
Final follow-up: all four reported findings are addressed in the worktree. README JSON examples now use bun run --silent review; actual success exit0/error exit1 both produced exactly one stdout JSON and zero stderr bytes. Prerequisites name only selected kinds and examples retain caller BD_ACTOR. ScopeRequest now documents each variant field. Added native successful runSubmission -> selected job -> Busy Bee task/request test using scripted Bee services (not just dry-run). Also removed path trimming from scope/job parsers and made that successful submission case use a real leading-space filename, asserting exact scope and assigned path preservation. Focused review.test.ts now passes 7 tests/38 assertions; focused lint/format pass. Please include these final fixes if still reviewing; no snapshots, scheduling, ownership or repair-policy changes were introduced.

